**Bug**: The `add_problem` method silently ignored invalid input instead of raising an error or properly validating it.

**Root Cause**: The method used duck typing (`if hasattr(entry, "problem"):`) which accepted any object with a `problem` attribute, even if it lacked other required attributes (`status`, `resolution`) or had invalid values.

